{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31291","headline":"闰三月 · 刘威","name":"闰三月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年皆一闰，此闰胜常时。\n莫怪花开晚，都缘春尽迟。\n节分炎气近，律应蕙风移。\n梦得成胡蝶，芳菲幸不遗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}